       "text": "Operators of ships in the 400-5,000 GT band face monitoring duties now (MRV) and may face allowance and fuel-intensity duties if the EU report and the IMO discussion both lead to extension; the rows state the examination and the discussion, not a decision.",
       "status_token": "HYPOTHESIS",
       "basis": [
        "section_claim_provenance:476a1d5f-454d-4a29-84d8-118ee9340ef8",
        "item_forward_events:061f527f-8a70-41e2-987f-ffd63b6f93e1",
        "section_claim_provenance:d5c5f703-b8d1-4711-9d86-df4722fc37da"
       ]
